// Use the shared block +wallet without defining it in the diagram
architecture Sign and send from a wallet

box dapp as dApp [note: builds the transaction, icon: app]
+wallet w as Wallet [note: holds the key]
box node as RPC node [note: accepts transactions, icon: server]

step Ask to sign
  say The dApp builds the transaction and asks the wallet to sign it.
  dapp -> w: sign request

step Send
  say The wallet signs with its key and sends the signed transaction to the RPC node.
  w -> node: signed transaction
